    build: remove empty Datadog.xcworkspace (SPM scheme resolution + zero-Datadog)
    
    The stale Datadog.xcworkspace (dev-only, .xcworkspace is SKIPped by the rebrand)
    had no schemes and hijacked `xcodebuild -scheme OpenObserveRUM`, hiding the SPM
    package's auto-generated schemes. Removed so xcodebuild resolves Package.swift
    directly (OpenObserveRUM/Core/... schemes) — and it drops a Datadog-named file.
    Regenerate an OpenObserve.xcworkspace locally if you want one for the IDE.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

